# Feel, the keys' touch (params: 6 Sympathy 39 MIDI out 41 Feel). The FM-1's keys are on / off, so
# Expressive (the default) plays the touch in time: a quick tap rings shorter, a key held presses in
# (fuller, darker), and a controller's pressure presses over MIDI. Classic: the sound as it always was.
# The note: A3 (5700) on white key 9 of the D Kurd; Sympathy off (each note on its own)
tap HOME
spin K3 -50
expect par6 0
expect par41 0
wav touch.wav
# a quick tap: at ~1.5 s, a little down (Classic: ~40)
tapkey w9
wait 1440
expect level5700 <33
wait 4000
# held: nothing for ~0.3 s, then the hand presses in, all of it by ~1.5 s; let go, it comes off
key w9 down
wait 250
expect touchw9 0
wait 500
expect touchw9 >20
expect touchw9 <80
wait 750
expect touchw9 127
expect level5700 <50
key w9 up
expect touchw9 0
wait 4000
# MIDI in: poly pressure (A0) on a note held over MIDI, then channel pressure (D0) on all of them
midi 90 39 64
wait 300
midi A0 39 7F
wait 1200
expect level5700 <50
midi 80 39 00
wait 4000
midi 90 39 64
wait 300
midi D0 7F 00
wait 1200
expect level5700 <50
midi 80 39 00
wait 4000
# MIDI out: the pressure goes out as poly pressure, ~30 messages a press (and the note on and off)
tap GLO
spin K3 1
expect par39 1
expect midi_out 0
key w9 down
wait 1600
key w9 up
expect midi_out >25
expect midi_out <45
wait 4000
wavstop
# Classic: ENV pressed again, the Feel page
tap ENV
expect view 2
tap ENV
expect view 11
spin K1 1
expect par41 1
wait 50
shot classic.png
wav classic.wav
# the tap rings on, the key held never presses, nothing goes out but the note, MIDI pressure is ignored
tapkey w9
wait 1440
expect level5700 >30
wait 4000
expect midi_out 33
key w9 down
wait 1500
expect touchw9 0
expect level5700 >50
key w9 up
wait 4000
expect midi_out 35
midi 90 39 64
wait 300
midi A0 39 7F
wait 1200
expect level5700 >50
midi 80 39 00
wait 4000
wavstop
# saved, it stays Classic; a project saved before Feel existed comes up Expressive
tap SAVE
reboot
expect par41 1
v1project
reboot
expect par41 0
wait 1500
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 11
wait 50
shot feel.png
